o.webp\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" alt=\"Illustrated food with bread, pasta, rice, meat, fish, cheese, egg and apple\" decoding=\"async\">\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"section compact-top\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"word-grid\"><article class=\"word-card\">\n      <img src=\"../../assets/vocabolario/pane.webp\" alt=\"A loaf of bread\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      <div class=\"word-card-body\"><h2>il pane</h2><div class=\"word-examples\"><strong>3 example sentences</strong><ol>\n        <li><span lang=\"it\">Compro il pane fresco.</span></li><li><span lang=\"it\">Taglio una fetta di pane.</span></li><li><span lang=\"it\">Mangio il pane con il formaggio.</span></li>\n      </ol></div><button class=\"speak-word\" data-word=\"il pane\" type=\"button\">🔊 Listen</button></div>\n    </article><article class=\"word-card\">\n      <img src=\"../../assets/vocabolario/pasta.webp\" alt=\"Some pasta\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      <div class=\"word-card-body\"><h2>la pasta</h2><div class=\"word-examples\"><strong>3 example sentences</strong><ol>\n        <li><span lang=\"it\">Cucino la pasta.</span></li><li><span lang=\"it\">La pasta è al dente.</span></li><li><span lang=\"it\">Condisco la pasta con il pomodoro.</span></li>\n      </ol></div><button class=\"speak-word\" data-word=\"la pasta\" type=\"button\">🔊 Listen</button></div>\n    </article><article class=\"word-card\">\n      <img src=\"../../assets/vocabolario/riso.webp\" alt=\"Some rice\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      <div class=\"word-card-body\"><h2>il riso</h2><div class=\"word-examples\"><strong>3 example sentences</strong><ol>\n        <li><span lang=\"it\">Il riso cuoce nella pentola.</span></li><li><span lang=\"it\">Mangio il riso con le verdure.</span></li><li><span lang=\"it\">Il riso è ancora caldo.</span></li>\n      </ol></div><button class=\"speak-word\" data-word=\"il riso\" type=\"button\">🔊 Liste