abel\">Translate freely</span><strong lang=\"en\">The pasta is al dente.</strong></p>\n      <label for=\"translation-2\">Your translation</label><textarea id=\"translation-2\" rows=\"2\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"true\"></textarea>\n      <div class=\"translation-actions\"><button class=\"show-translation\" type=\"button\">Shows the proposed solution</button></div>\n      <p class=\"proposed-solution\" hidden=\"\"><span>Proposed solution:</span> <strong>La pasta è al dente.</strong></p>\n    </div></article><article class=\"translation-exercise\" data-key=\"3\"><div class=\"exercise-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</div><div class=\"translation-exercise-body\">\n      <p class=\"translation-prompt\"><span class=\"prompt-label\">Translate freely</span><strong lang=\"en\">I eat rice with vegetables.</strong></p>\n      <label for=\"translation-3\">Your translation</label><textarea id=\"translation-3\" rows=\"2\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"true\"></textarea>\n      <div class=\"translation-actions\"><button class=\"show-translation\" type=\"button\">Shows the proposed solution</button></div>\n      <p class=\"proposed-solution\" hidden=\"\"><span>Proposed solution:</span> <strong>Mangio il riso con le verdure.</strong></p>\n    </div></article><article class=\"translation-exercise\" data-key=\"4\"><div class=\"exercise-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</div><div class=\"translation-exercise-body\">\n      <p class=\"translation-prompt\"><span class=\"prompt-label\">Translate freely</span><strong lang=\"en\">I cook the meat on the grill.</strong></p>\n      <label for=\"translation-4\">Your translation</label><textarea id=\"translation-4\" rows=\"2\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"true\"></textarea>\n      <div class=\"translation-actions\"><button class=\"show-translation\" type=\"button\">Shows the proposed solution</button></div>\n      <p class=\"proposed-solution\" hidden=\"\"><span>Proposed solution:</span> <strong>Cucino la carne alla griglia.</strong></p>\n    </div></article><article class=\"translation-exercise\" data-key=\"5\"><div class=\"exercise-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</div><div class=\"translation-exercise-body\">\n      <p class=\"translation-prompt\"><span class=\"prompt-label\">Translate freely</span><strong lang=\"en\">I cook the fish in the oven.</strong></p>\n      <label for=\"translation-5\">Your translation</label><textarea id=\"translation-5\" rows=\"2\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"true\"></textarea>\n      <div class=\"translation-actions\"><button class=\"show-translation\" type=\"button\">Shows the proposed solution</button></div>\n      <p class=\"proposed-solution\" hidden=\"\"><span>Proposed solution:</span> <strong>Cucino il pesce al forno.</strong></p>\n    </div></article><article class=\"translation-exercise\" data-key=\"6\"><div class=\"exercise-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</div><div class=\"translation-exercise-body\">\n      <p class=\"translation-prompt\"><span class=\"prompt-label\">Translate freely</span><strong lang=\"en\">The cheese is in the refrigerator.</strong></p>\n      <label for=\"translation-6\">Your translation</label><textarea id=\"translation-6\" rows=\"2\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"true\"></textarea>\n      <div class=\"translation-actions\"><button class=\"show-translation\" type=\"button\">Shows the proposed solution</button></div>\n      <p class=\"proposed-solution\" hidden=\"\"><span>Proposed solution:</span> <strong>Il formaggio è nel frigorifero.</strong></p>\n    </div></article><article class=\"translation-exercise\" data-key=\"7\"><div class=\"exercise-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</div><div class=\"translation-exercise-body\">\n      <p class=\"translation-prompt\"><span class=\"prompt-label\">Translate freely</span><strong lang=\"en\">I eat an egg for breakfast.</strong></p>\n      <label for=\"translation-7\">Your translation</label><textarea id=\"translation-7\" rows=\"2\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"true\"></text